//ROD OF SMITING +2 - solo maghi e chierici - 7500mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/RODS04.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Staff"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Rods are about three feet long and as thick as your thumb. They are normally found in cases or similar storage places. Rods can be fashioned from metal, wood, ivory, or bone. They can be plain or decorated and carved, tipped, or not. Rods are powered by charges, unless noted otherwise in the description of a particular rod. Each time the rod is used, one or more charge may be expended.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Rod of Smiting +2"
	SAY DESC "This long, thin rod can be wielded as a staff. This rod has been designed to destroy golems. Any golem struck by the rod must make a Saving Throw or be destroyed. In the hands of any other than a cleric or mage, the rod becomes unusable.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Strikes golem as +5

Combat abilities:
– Struck golems must save vs. Death or be destroyed

THAC0: +2
Damage: 1d6+2, +10 vs. golems
Damage type: Crushing
Speed Factor: 2
Proficiency Type: Quarterstaff
Type: Two-handed

Weight: 3
"





