	SAY NAME2 "Staff of the Ram +6"
	SAY DESC "The Staff of the Ram is a weapon of deceptive simplicity and earth-shattering force. Crafted from the wood of an iron-oak tree that grew atop the highest peak of the Mount Tozal, the staff was tempered in the crushing depths of the Elemental Plane of Earth. The name of the weapon comes from its unique enchantment: the tip of the staff is capped with an invisible, magical force shaped like a charging ram’s head. When the wielder strikes, this force is unleashed with a thunderous roar, magnifying the physical blow a hundredfold.
	
	Roranach's Horn augments the Staff of the Ram's already noteworthy abilities, creating a weapon few opponents are able to stand against.

